type of wisdom.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4874')\">BDB4874</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4912')\">H4912</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4873')\">BDB4873</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4875')\">BDB4875</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>מָשָׁל</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 14:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,4)\">Isa 14:4</ref></sup> <highlightword>proverb, parable</highlightword> (of sentences constructed in <highlight>parallelism</highlight>, usually of Hebrew Wisdom, but occasionally of other types); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,2)\">Ezek 17:2</ref> + 20 t.; construct <bdbheb>מְשַׁל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 24:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,24,14)\">1Sam 24:14</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מְשָׁלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 23:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,7)\">Num 23:7</ref> + 8 t.; plural <bdbheb>מְשָׁלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:9\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,9)\">Eccl 12:9</ref> + 2 t.; construct <bdbheb>מִשְׁלֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 1:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,1)\">Prov 1:1</ref> + 3 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>proverbial saying</highlight>, brief terse sentence of popular sagacity <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,12)\">1Sam 10:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,22)\">Ezek 12:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,23)\">Ezek 12:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eze