4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,3)\">Num 24:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 24:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,15)\">Num 24:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 24:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,20)\">Num 24:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 24:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,21)\">Num 24:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 24:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,23)\">Num 24:23</ref> (all of Balaam); <ref ref=\"Isa 14:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,4)\">Isa 14:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 2:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,2,4)\">Mic 2:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נהי</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Hab 2:6\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,6)\">Hab 2:6</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חידה</bdbheb>), (compare <ref ref=\"Job 27:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,1)\">Job 27:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 29:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,1)\">Job 29:1</ref> for same phrase under <b>6</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>similitude, parable</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,2)\">Ezek 17:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,5)\">Ezek 21:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,3)\">Ezek 24:3</ref>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>poem</highlight>, of various kinds: the ode (<ref ref=\"Num 21:27-30\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,27)\">Num 21:27-30</ref>), the 3,000 pieces traditionally ascribed to Solomon <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,12)\">1Kgs 5:12</ref>, didactic psalms <ref ref=\"Ps 49:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,49,5)\">Ps 49:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 78:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,2)\">Ps 78:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>sentences of ethical wisdom</highlight> <bdbheb>דִּבְרֵי חֲכָמִים</bdbheb> collected in the <bdbheb>מִשְׁלֵי שְׁלֹמֹה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,1)\">Prov 10:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 25:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,1)\">Prov 25:1</ref> (<ref ref=\"Prov 10:1-22:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,1)\">Prov 10:1-22:16</ref> consisting of 376 couplets chiefly antithetical; <ref ref=\"Prov 25:1-29:200\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,1)\">Prov 25:1-29:200</ref> chiefly couplets of an emblematic type, but also occasional tristichs, tetrastichs, pentastichs, and decastichs. To these are appended <bdbheb>דְּבָרִים</bdbheb> of a more mixed character as to size and content <ref ref=\"Prov 30:1-14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,1)\">Prov 30:1-14</ref> v<ref ref=\"Prov 30:15-33\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,15)\">Prov 30:15-33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 31:1-9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,1)\">Prov 31:1-9</ref> v<ref ref=\"Prov 31:10-31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,10)\">Prov 31:10-31</ref> the Praise of Wisdom <ref ref=\"Prov 1:8-9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,8)\">Prov 1:8-9</ref> is prefixed, and an introduction to the whole <ref ref=\"Prov 1:1-7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,1)\">Prov 1:1-7</ref>, in which the whole contents are represented as) <bdbheb>משׁלים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 1:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,1)\">Prov 1:1</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Prov 1:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,6)\">Prov 1:6</ref>. The references in <ref ref=\"Job 13:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,12)\">Job 13:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 27:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,1)\">Job 27:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 29:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,1)\">Job 29:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,7)\">Prov 26:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,9)\">Prov 26:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:9\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,9)\">Eccl 12:9</ref> are to the same type of wisdom. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 14:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 17:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 17, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "1Sam 24:14", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 24, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Num 23:7", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 23, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Eccl 12:9", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 12, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Prov 1:1", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "1Sam 10:12", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Ezek 12:22", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 12, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezek 12:23", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 12, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Ezek 18:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 18, "verse": 2}, {"raw":